      "en": "Now the Philistines fought against Israel; and the men of Israel fled from before the Philistines, and fell down slain on Mount Gilboa.",
      "ko": "블레셋 사람과 이스라엘이 싸우더니 이스라엘 사람들이 블레셋 사람 앞에서 도망하다가 길보아산에서 죽임을 받고 엎드러지니라",
      "source_text_hash": "2224f27c504aba2ef8de0178133830063a133164532a6e7803ef19a9dfc3165c",
      "translation_text_hash": "b355cc8b67489495454294579fd700d5ec2518aa6bb82bbb082bc4cc77cd9fa5",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
