      "en": "When his armor bearer saw that Saul was dead, he likewise fell on his sword and died.",
      "ko": "병기 가진 자가 사울의 죽음을 보고 자기도 칼에 엎드러져 죽으니라",
      "source_text_hash": "bb359e41c748ed522e1a60eeb6c3c43c27c0c9942c8091e3a51c67a24124da6f",
      "translation_text_hash": "e42c7cf88f12b4271ab4277a97e34f965666389385511fb79cbca4217e4b48ca",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
