      "en": "So Saul died with his three sons; and all his house died together.",
      "ko": "이와 같이 사울과 그 세 아들과 그 온 집이 함께 죽으니라",
      "source_text_hash": "6fc911781559412c8ceb37fcfa1b05eb516cf44dc3821de2f474a9abe2b604b7",
      "translation_text_hash": "6eb5b7f489e6c6884422917944f7d0a9131b88a4ff26be235b11608d6c1176ce",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
