      "en": "They put his armor in the house of their gods, and fastened his head in the house of Dagon.",
      "ko": "사울의 갑옷을 그 신의 묘에 두고 그 머리를 다곤의 묘에 단지라",
      "source_text_hash": "03e8ecbc5448b444ac9292147ab9301b262d30e7754f09deb0f7e0356e957e4f",
      "translation_text_hash": "b3af2b05c02e03aba4c05975cb8cadece51d10ef599fc95cc18c6417ea399998",
