      "en": "So Saul died for his trespass which he committed against the LORD, because of the LORD’s word, which he didn’t keep, and also because he asked counsel of one who had a familiar spirit, to inquire,",
      "ko": "사울의 죽은 것은 여호와께 범죄하였음이라 저가 여호와의 말씀을 지키지 아니하고 또 신접한 자에게 가르치기를 청하고",
      "source_text_hash": "2cc75f9eab3e5ee674b5296be94db1528b6f36c669ce9b54ed81dec2237e0757",
      "translation_text_hash": "7f01a1735b8f578253eb99635bf3cc2fa4fb1f189a86a1d4309dd08b6b53dafa",
